      <title>Deniz Undav named Bundesliga Player of the Month for March</title>
      <link>https://www.bundesliga.com/en/bundesliga/news/player-of-the-month-2025-26-vote-winners-ea-sports-34233</link>
      <description>The Bundesliga is once again presenting the official Player of the Month award for the 2025/26 season. The vote has been conducted by the DFL Deutsche Fußball Liga in cooperation with its official licensing partner EA SPORTS since 2018/19. Deniz Undav has won the award for March 2026, ahead of Paul Nebel, Yan Diomande, Hannes Behrens, Konstantinos Koulierakis and Igor Matanović.</description>
